L0,LAS		/Read switches
RAL		/Switch 0?
SZL
JMP I LT0I	/ Yes, go start player
RTR		/Switch 11?
SNL
JMP L0		/No, go check again!
CLA		/Switch 11 is on, read a tape
TAD N480	/Reset default speed
DCA Y
DCA KA		/Reset the Key signature to neutrals
DCA KB
DCA KC
DCA KD
